<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Amrogn Chicken | Menu</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Amrogn Chicken is a beloved Addis Ababa restaurant serving fresh chicken, family meals, sides, and drinks."
    />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700;800&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="container topbar-inner">
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="brand-mark">AC</div>
          <div>
            <p class="brand-name">AMROGN</p>
            <p class="brand-subtitle">CHICKEN</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <nav class="nav">
          <a href="#menu">Menu</a>
          <a href="#offers">Offers</a>
          <a href="#branches">Branches</a>
          <a href="#about">About</a>
          <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
        <a class="cta-link" href="#branches">Find a Branch</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="container hero-inner">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <span class="eyebrow">A local favorite in Addis Ababa</span>
            <p class="hero-badge">Since 2012 • Addis Ababa’s chicken favorite</p>
            <h1>The taste of Addis Ababa, served hot and fresh.</h1>
            <p>
              Crispy, juicy, and unforgettable — Amrogn Chicken is a well-loved
              local restaurant in Addis Ababa, serving family meals, quick lunch bites,
              and chicken favorites that keep customers coming back.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="primary-btn" href="#menu">View Menu</a>
              <a class="secondary-btn" href="#branches">Find your branch</a>
            </div>
            <ul class="highlights">
              <li>Fresh daily</li>
              <li>Family combo deals</li>
              <li>Fast delivery</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="hero-trust">
              <span>Trusted by Addis families</span>
              <span>Quality you can taste</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-card">
            <div class="card-badge">Popular today</div>
            <div class="dish-image">
              <div class="image-glow"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="dish-meta">
              <div>
                <p class="meta-label">Signature plate</p>
                <h3>Amrogn Special</h3>
              </div>
              <span class="price">ETB 490</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="stats">
        <div class="container stats-grid">
          <div>
            <strong>10K+</strong>
            <span>Happy customers</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>15 min</strong>
            <span>Average prep time</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>4.9/5</strong>
            <span>Customer rating</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Daily</strong>
            <span>Freshly made</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="menu" class="menu-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="eyebrow">Our menu</span>
            <h2>Flavor-packed favorites</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="menu-grid">
            <article class="menu-category">
              <h3>Signature Chicken</h3>

              <div class="menu-item">
                <div>
                  <h4>Amrogn Special Chicken</h4>
                  <p>Golden fried chicken, house sauce, fresh salad, fries.</p>
                </div>
                <span>ETB 490</span>
              </div>

              <div class="menu-item">
                <div>
                  <h4>Spicy Grilled Chicken</h4>
                  <p>Char-grilled chicken with chili peppers and pepper sauce.</p>
                </div>
                <span>ETB 520</span>
              </div>

              <div class="menu-item">
                <div>
                  <h4>Peri-Peri Chicken</h4>
                  <p>Bold flavor, smoky finish, served with fries and coleslaw.</p>
                </div>
                <span>ETB 540</span>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="menu-category">
              <h3>Family Meals</h3>

              <div class="menu-item">
                <div>
                  <h4>Family Feast</h4>
                  <p>8 pieces chicken, large fries, 2 soft drinks, salad.</p>
                </div>
                <span>ETB 1,350</span>
              </div>

              <div class="menu-item">
                <div>
                  <h4>Party Bucket</h4>
                  <p>12 pieces chicken, roasted potatoes, dips, and family sides.</p>
                </div>
                <span>ETB 1,900</span>
              </div>

              <div class="menu-item">
                <div>
                  <h4>Combo Family Box</h4>
                  <p>Chicken, fries, rice, salad, and sauce selections.</p>
                </div>
                <span>ETB 1,650</span>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="menu-category">
              <h3>Sides & Appetizers</h3>

              <div class="menu-item">
                <div>
                  <h4>French Fries</h4>
                  <p>Crispy and golden, perfectly salted.</p>
                </div>
                <span>ETB 120</span>
              </div>

              <div class="menu-item">
                <div>
                  <h4>Chicken Wings</h4>
                  <p>Sticky, spicy, and crunchy. Great as a shareable snack.</p>
                </div>
                <span>ETB 180</span>
              </div>

              <div class="menu-item">
                <div>
                  <h4>Mini Chicken Wrap</h4>
                  <p>Loaded chicken, crunchy veggies, and creamy dressing.</p>
                </div>
                <span>ETB 220</span>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="menu-category">
              <h3>Drinks & Desserts</h3>

              <div class="menu-item">
                <div>
                  <h4>Soft Drinks</h4>
                  <p>Choose from Coca-Cola, Sprite, Fanta, and more.</p>
                </div>
                <span>ETB 60</span>
              </div>

              <div class="menu-item">
                <div>
                  <h4>Fresh Juice</h4>
                  <p>Orange, mango, avocado, and mixed fruit options.</p>
                </div>
                <span>ETB 110</span>
              </div>

              <div class="menu-item">
                <div>
                  <h4>Chocolate Cake Slice</h4>
                  <p>Rich, creamy, and ideal to finish your meal.</p>
                </div>
                <span>ETB 160</span>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="offers" class="offers">
        <div class="container offers-inner">
          <div class="section-heading small-gap">
            <span class="eyebrow">Special offers</span>
            <h2>Great value, every day</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="offer-cards">
            <div class="offer-card">
              <span>Lunch Combo</span>
              <strong>ETB 350</strong>
              <p>Chicken + fries + drink</p>
            </div>
            <div class="offer-card highlight">
              <span>Weekend Deal</span>
              <strong>ETB 690</strong>
              <p>Two crispy chicken meals + sides</p>
            </div>
            <div class="offer-card">
              <span>Family Pack</span>
              <strong>ETB 1,250</strong>
              <p>Perfect for sharing at home</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="branches" class="branches">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="eyebrow">Find us</span>
            <h2>Amrogn Chicken branches across Addis Ababa</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="branch-grid">
            <div class="branch-card">
              <h3>Piassa</h3>
              <p>Central Addis favorite</p>
            </div>
            <div class="branch-card">
              <h3>4 Kilo</h3>
              <p>Popular student and family stop</p>
            </div>
            <div class="branch-card">
              <h3>Bole Wello Sefer</h3>
              <p>Convenient for busy city traffic</p>
            </div>
            <div class="branch-card">
              <h3>Mekanisa</h3>
              <p>Neighborhood favorite</p>
            </div>
            <div class="branch-card">
              <h3>CMC</h3>
              <p>Fast service and family meals</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="branches-note">
            You can find more Amrogn Chicken locations and updates on the official website.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="about" class="about">
        <div class="container about-inner">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">About us</span>
            <h2>Authentic taste. Warm hospitality.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            For years, Amrogn Chicken has been serving meals made with care,
            bold spices, and the kind of taste that keeps customers returning in Addis Ababa.
            From quick chicken lunches to family dinners, every order is prepared
            to satisfy your craving and bring people back for more.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer id="contact" class="footer">
      <div class="container footer-inner">
        <div>
          <p class="brand-name footer-brand">AMROGN</p>
          <p class="brand-subtitle">CHICKEN</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Locations</h4>
          <p>Piassa</p>
          <p>4 Kilo</p>
          <p>Bole Wello Sefer</p>
          <p>Mekanisa</p>
          <p>CMC</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Visit & Order</h4>
          <p>Wollo Sefer: 0910964646</p>
          <p>Check the official website for the latest offers, pricing, and branch updates.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Hours</h4>
          <p>Mon - Sat: 10:00 AM - 10:00 PM</p>
          <p>Sun: 11:00 AM - 9:00 PM</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="container legal">
        <p>© <span id="year"></span> Amrogn Chicken. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
